  "bio": [
   {
    "text": "Bontu set the Trial of Ambition for the initiates, naming Gideon and the Tah crop to face it.",
    "cites": [
     "brazen-2017-05-03-e6",
     "brazen-2017-05-03-e7"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Not%20even%20the%20gods%3F",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=You%20shall%20be%20next%20to%20face%20my%20Trial"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "She demanded a heart from each of the nine survivors as a toll, drained Gideon's strength with her gaze, and then rebuked him and ordered him out of her temple.",
    "cites": [
     "brazen-2017-05-03-e20",
     "brazen-2017-05-03-e23",
     "brazen-2017-05-03-e25",
     "brazen-2017-05-03-e26"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Pay%20the%20toll%2C%20or%20fall%20short%20and%20perish.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Watch%2C%20Kytheon%20Iora.%20Quiet%20your%20judgment%2C%20and%20learn.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=You%20look%20only%20for,your%20sense%20of%20justice.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=The%20anointed%20are%20the,initiates%20fallen%20in%20battle."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "When the gods gathered at the Luxa, the God-Pharaoh did not arrive, and Hapatra resolved to find Bontu and Hazoret and keep them alive.",
    "cites": [
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e2",
     "hour-promise-2017-06-28-e16"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=The%20five%20stood%20before,shores%20of%20the%20Luxa",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-promise-2017-06-28#:~:text=We%20must%20find%20Bontu,alive%20at%20all%20costs."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "With only she and Hazoret left, Bontu knelt to Nicol Bolas, revealed that she had served him and culled dissenters, and at his command attacked her sister Hazoret.",
    "cites": [
     "favor-2017-07-05-e0",
     "favor-2017-07-05-e8",
     "favor-2017-07-05-e9",
     "favor-2017-07-05-r3"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Bontu%20and%20I%20are%20all%20that%20remain.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=I%20have%20culled%20dissenters%20from%20all%20the%20crops",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Kill%20your%20sister.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Have%20you%20forgotten%20who%20I%20am%2C%20sister%3F"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "She explained that she chose survival by joining Bolas, and after the sisters duelled she drained Hazoret and dropped her at Bolas's feet.",
    "cites": [
     "favor-2017-07-05-e11",
     "favor-2017-07-05-e13"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=I%20chose%20to%20join,instead.%20I%20chose%20survival.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Slowly%2C%20he%20raised%20one,bolt%20of%20dark%20energy."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Bolas then blasted Bontu, calling her usefulness ended, and she burst free of the undead, freed Hazoret, and died.",
    "cites": [
     "favor-2017-07-05-e13",
     "favor-2017-07-05-e15",
     "favor-2017-07-05-r1"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Slowly%2C%20he%20raised%20one,bolt%20of%20dark%20energy.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Bontu%20fell%2C%20the%20dragon%27s,god%20to%20this%20world.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=the%20dragon%27s%20necrotic%20spell,god%20to%20this%20world."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "As a God-Eternal she later bit Bolas and harvested all his Sparks, exploding in the process.",
    "cites": [
     "war-spark-ravnica-ashes-2019-06-12-e15",
     "war-spark-ravnica-ashes-2019-06-12-r6"
    ],
    "links": [
